>Douay, but don't let that bind you. Douay calls that psalm 121.
>
There are some small differences in numbering (esp. of verses) among 
versions of the Bible.  In Jewish tradition, it's #122.  (oh... there's 
also the "song of ascents, of David" verse at the beginning that should 
be included).

